id: GUIDE7-5
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: hint_count_monotone
target: crates/core/src/go_to.rs
find:     state.run.busy = None;
replace:     state.run.busy = None; state.hints_opened.retain(|k, _| k.0 == to.0);
expect-fail: goto_other_root_and_back_keeps_counts
expect-fail: property_hint_counts_never_decrease
note: 移動が移動先以外のヒントの使用回数を落とす
